5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to work with you all. To ensure our plans are realistic, I wonder if we should look into the site diaries and the delivery schedules to understand past delays?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hello! I'm so happy to be here with you all! @Shizue, that sounds like a great start. I also think we should check how rooms are actually being used and if the timetables are struggling.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. While usage is important, we must not overlook the people maintaining these facilities. I believe we should examine the bench technicians' weekly manual routines and the staffing posts since the freeze.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with the points raised. However, we should also evaluate the actual success of past projects. I suggest we look into the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks to gauge user satisfaction.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. While user satisfaction and staffing are noble pursuits, I suspect our projections often suffer from a certain... optimistic detachment from market reality. I suggest we examine the tender records and renewal reserves.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we all have very thoughtful perspectives. @Benjamin, your point about market reality is quite sobering. Perhaps combining your financial focus with my concerns about timing will give us a more honest picture?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I totally agree! It's like putting together a puzzle. If we combine the money, the timing, and how students and teachers actually use the rooms, we'll make a choice that really helps everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree that a comprehensive view is necessary. However, let us remember that no facility functions without the staff. We must ensure the chosen plan does not simply add more burden to an already exhausted team.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, your concern for the staff is valid. However, if we ignore the users' actual experiences, we risk building something that is technically maintainable but practically useless. We need a balance between operational capacity and user utility.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A balance is indeed essential, @Mizuki. However, the most elegant design is merely a theoretical exercise if the budget evaporates before the first brick is laid. Logic suggests we prioritize financial viability first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is so lovely to see us all thinking of different people. @Benjamin, while logic is important, I worry that a plan on paper can still slip away from us in practice. Shall we agree to look into these various points?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Yes! Let's do it! I really want to make sure we don't forget about the people who have to fit their classes into the rooms. It would be so sad if we built something great but couldn't actually use it!,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I believe we have covered the essential angles. I will proceed with looking into the staffing posts and the technicians' routines to ensure we are not overlooking the human cost of these improvements.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will focus on the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks. It is crucial to understand where we have failed in the past to ensure we succeed this time.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall follow suit. To ensure our financial optimism doesn't veer into fantasy, I will examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier. Logic, after all, requires data.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. To help us avoid any unexpected surprises with our timeline, I will look into the weather days in the site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale. I look forward to our findings.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll look into the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the timetable records on rooms out of service! I can't wait to see what we find. Let's make this a great project together!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I believe we have a solid plan. I shall now review the data regarding our staff and their routines. I look forward to seeing how your findings complement these operational realities.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have a comprehensive approach. By combining financial, operational, and user-centric data, we can make a truly informed decision. I look forward to seeing how our findings intersect.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It appears we have a most comprehensive arrangement. I shall delve into the numbers and see if they possess the courage to tell us the truth. I look forward to our next gathering.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
